  "notes": "Used in both environmental and industrial/technical contexts. In environmental contexts, similar to ⟦{保護|ほご}→保護：03625_hogo⟧ (protection) but emphasizes maintaining the current state rather than active intervention. In industrial contexts, refers to maintenance work to keep equipment running properly.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{環境|かんきょう}→環境：00174_kankyou⟧{保全|ほぜん} (environmental conservation)\n- ⟦{自然|しぜん}→自然：01423_shizen⟧{保全|ほぜん} (nature conservation)\n- ⟦{安全|あんぜん}→安全：01131_anzen⟧{保全|ほぜん} (safety maintenance)\n- ⟦{設備|せつび}→設備：03301_setsubi⟧{保全|ほぜん} (facility/equipment maintenance)\n- {保全|ほぜん}⟦{活動|かつどう}→活動：00201_katsudou⟧ (conservation activities)",
